+// TEMPORARY diagnostic: GPU timestamp profiler for DeferredCommandBuffer::Execute.
+// Enabled with env TRIALS_GPU_PROF=1. Writes bottom-of-pipe timestamps at every
+// "boundary" command and attributes the interval to that command's category.
